<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60734" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῠλοιδιάω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύλα,
		οἰδάω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>have a swelling
				below the eye, have a black eye</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυλοιδιᾶν ἀνάγκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					472
				</span></i>
			; <i>have dark rings under the eyes</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ὑπ᾽ ἔρωτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					1.38
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>have a swollen face</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.27.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				478
			</span></i>.</div>
